From bc3d5a853526f8896b3f2f647812eadbaa0622b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 22:12:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0182: a save loaded with NEW DIGIMON off turns a
 partner of a new species into its vanilla species (the record's vanillaAs,
 from the species files' vanilla_as): stats, care and age kept, the same
 techniques re-slotted (else its first learned one, else its first one,
 learned), its own finisher. SAVE_TAG_VANILLA_SWAP remembers it; loaded with
 the option on and the partner still that species, it is turned back. Raised
 and recruited flags stay

---
